>Marisa</span>: Welcome to the team.  Let me show you around.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: OK.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn5le16ob06re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marisa</span>: We'll start with your office.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Could you clarify that please? Is it my own?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marisa</span>:  Not quite. This is an office shared by the freelancers, but you'll all be in on different days.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm not quite sure I know what you mean.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marisa</span>: What I mean is that there might be times when you get the office all to yourself.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Ah, I see what you mean. Does the entire editorial team work here?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marisa</span>: Not everyone, but most of us do. You'll meet your boss today. You may meet the art director and the photographers. They're here every now and then.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Cool.", "time": "19500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn5le16ob06re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marisa</span>: I'll introduce you to our copy editor and proofreaders. You may want to get acquainted with them quickly.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Do you mean that I'll be writing soon?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marisa</span>: I don't see why not. Speaking of ... there's Victoria. She's the right person to ask about that.", "time": "60000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}